oves overall stylistic consistency by ensuring our `memdelete_notnull` helper macro is used when a `memdelete` has a prerequisite `nullptr` check.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nInstances were found & replaced with the following regex in VSCode:\r\n- Search\r\n```regex\r\n(\\s*)if \\((.*)(?: != nullptr)?\\) \\{\\n\\s*memdelete\\(\\2\\);\\n\\s*\\}\r\n```\r\n- Replace\r\n```regex\r\n$1memdelete_notnull($2);\r\n```\r\nExactly one instance of a standalone `nullptr` conditional for `memdelete` remains: this case where it's immediately followed with an `else` condition\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/2c089e9bf0b8712d0bc444c2ceaf9c543ed9c777/modules/openxr/openxr_api.cpp#L1871-L1873","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2304948121,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMzA0OTQ4MTIx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:codestyle","name":"topic:codestyle","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-07-12T19:23:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-15T16:06:54Z","closed_at":"2026-07-15T16:06:46Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"b7f5daee9d743421e2b662c8dd38f1399c65a213","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"Repiteo:style/memdelete_notnull","ref":"style/memdelete_notnull","repo":{"id":607282518,"node_id":"R_kgDOJDJlVg","name":"godot","full_name":"Repiteo/godot","owner":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url"